# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CivicFix AI Assistant – Environment Variables & API Key
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# - Never commit the real .env file with your private API key to public repositories.
# - Your API key is processed securely on the backend (server.ps1) and NEVER exposed to frontend clients.
#
# To enable Google Gemini AI Studio integration:
# 1. Get an API key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Copy this file to '.env' (in this folder):
#    Copy-Item .env.example .env
# 3. Paste your API key below:

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_google_ai_studio_api_key_here
